      <para>Use this system of equations to answer questions 1 – 4.</para>
      <para><quote>\( \begin{cases}3 x + 2y - z + 5w= 20 \\ y = 2z-3w\\ z=w+1 \\ 2w=8 \end{cases} \)</quote></para>

